# Content note:
# The playable scene (Content/Maps/L_Configurator.umap) and material
# (Content/Materials/M_Apartment.uasset) ARE committed — they are generated from code by
# Scripts/gen_configurator.py and can be regenerated at any time (see README). The UI itself
# is built entirely in C++ (RebuildWidget), so no WBP design assets are needed.
